#  Format description
#
#  Byte-by-byte description of file:
#  --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Bytes Format Units    Label     Explanations
#  --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#   4-11 A8     ---      Name      IVS source name in B1950 IAU notation
#  14-23 A10    ---      Name      RFC source ID   in J2000 IAU notation
#  26-27 I2     h        RAh       Hour of Right Ascension (J2000)
#  28-28 A1     ---      :         Delimiter: colon
#  29-30 I2     m        RAm       Minutes of Right Ascension (J2000)
#  32-41 F10.7  s        RAs       Second  of Right Ascension (J2000)
#  43-43 A1     ---      DE-       Sign of the Declination (J2000): either - or +
#  44-45 I2     deg      DEd       Degree of Declination (J2000)
#  46-46 A1     ---      :         Delimiter: colon
#  47-48 I2     arcmin   DEm       Arcminute  of Declination (J2000)
#  49-49 A1     ---      :         Delimiter: colon
#  50-58 F9.6   arcsec   DEs       Arcsecond  of Declination (J2000)
#  61-67 F7.3   arcsec   SigMaj    Semi-major error ellipse axis in mas
#  70-70 I1     ---      Class     Source class:
#                                                 0 -- non-detected source
#                                                 1 -- detected non-geodetic source
#                                                 2 -- geodetic source
#                                                 3 -- geodetic source candidate
#                                                 8 -- very extended source, not suitable for VLBI
#                                                 9 -- Ghost source
#  73-73 A1     ---      !         Delimiter: exclamation sign
#  75-   A      ---      Comm      Comment
#
